@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = techhive-hr-token-2026

### 1. Missing / Invalid Token -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### 2. List Users (Paginated & Filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Existing User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Non-Existent User -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create Valid User -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nadia Mansour",
  "email": "nadia.mansour@techhive.io",
  "department": "HR",
  "role": "Recruiter"
}

### 6. Create Invalid User -> 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "department": ""
}

### 7. Update User -> 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sarah Jenkins",
  "email": "sarah.jenkins@techhive.io",
  "department": "HR",
  "role": "Director of HR",
  "isActive": true
}

### 8. Delete User -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Trigger Unhandled Exception -> 500 JSON { "error": "Internal server error." }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/simulate-error
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}